  <!-- LEGAL OBLIGATIONS -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f1f5f9;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Formby Landlords. This Is a Legal Requirement.</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">Under the <a href="https://www.hse.gov.uk/gas/landlords/index.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gas Safety (Installation and Use) Regulations 1998</a>, every landlord must hold a valid CP12 for every rental property containing gas appliances. Non-compliance carries serious legal consequences.</p>

      <div class="pf-who-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-who-item" style="border-left:3px solid #b91c1c;">
          <div style="background:#b91c1c;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Barlow Condensed', 'Barlow Condensed Fallback', sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:1rem;min-width:1.75rem;height:1.75rem;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">1</div>
          <div><strong>Fines up to £6,000 per property</strong><p>The HSE and Sefton Council both enforce gas safety compliance. A single non-compliant Formby property can result in a fine up to £6,000. Criminal prosecution is possible in serious cases.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-who-item" style="border-left:3px solid #b91c1c;">
          <div style="background:#b91c1c;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Barlow Condensed', 'Barlow Condensed Fallback', sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:1rem;min-width:1.75rem;height:1.75rem;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">2</div>
          <div><strong>A lapsed CP12 blocks a Section 21 notice</strong><p>Courts have ruled that CP12 compliance is a legal prerequisite for a valid Section 21. A lapsed or unserved certificate can prevent eviction proceedings entirely. Annual renewal and same-day forwarding to tenants protects your Section 21 position on Formby rental properties.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-who-item" style="border-left:3px solid #b91c1c;">
          <div style="background:#b91c1c;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Barlow Condensed', 'Barlow Condensed Fallback', sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:1rem;min-width:1.75rem;height:1.75rem;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">3</div>
          <div><strong>Certificate must be provided to tenants within 28 days</strong><p>You must provide a copy of the valid CP12 to existing tenants within 28 days of issue and to new tenants before they move in. We email the digital certificate the same day so you can forward it to Formby tenants immediately.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-who-item" style="border-left:3px solid #b91c1c;">
          <div style="background:#b91c1c;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Barlow Condensed', 'Barlow Condensed Fallback', sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:1rem;min-width:1.75rem;height:1.75rem;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">4</div>
          <div><strong>Certificate must be renewed every 12 months</strong><p>A CP12 is valid for 12 months. Renewed between 10 and 12 months after the previous one, the new certificate runs from the old expiry date, preserving the full 12 months. We add all Formby landlords to our annual reminder list.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- WHAT IS CHECKED -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What Our Gas Safe Plumber Checks at Your Formby Property</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">The boiler, gas cooker and hob are each inspected individually and recorded on the CP12. 30 to 45 minutes per appliance.</p>
      <div class="pf-who-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Gas supply pressure and flow rate</strong><p>Gas supply pressure tested at the meter and at each appliance. Ensures correct supply throughout the Formby property including to a gas hob or range cooker at the opposite end of the building from the boiler.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Gas leak check</strong><p>All pipework and appliance connections tested for gas leaks using calibrated detection equipment. Any leak classified under the Gas Industry Unsafe Situations Procedure and addressed before we leave.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Flue integrity and combustion products</strong><p>All flues tested for integrity and safe discharge of combustion gases. For Formby coastal properties, external flue terminals checked for condition and corrosion.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Ventilation adequacy</strong><p>Each appliance we cover is checked for adequate ventilation. Particularly relevant for gas hobs in refitted kitchens where original ventilation may have been altered during renovation work.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Safety device operation</strong><p>All appliance safety devices tested individually. Flame failure devices on gas hobs tested. Each must demonstrate correct operation before the appliance can pass the inspection.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Signs of incomplete combustion</strong><p>Checked for staining, sooting or carbon deposits around all appliances. More common in older appliances than in modern sealed flue boilers.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Boiler, gas cooker and hob</strong><p>Each one inspected individually and recorded separately on the CP12. One certificate. We do not inspect gas fires. Tell us about one when you book.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>CP12 certificate issued and emailed same day</strong><p>Digital CP12 emailed the same day. Includes the engineer's Gas Safe registration number, inspection date and result for every appliance. Ready for your solicitor, letting agent or tenant immediately.</p></div></div>
